OL,3,GNEWSABusinesses fined over waste
OL,4,Aoffences
OL,5,
OL,6,FBedford Borough Council has secured a
OL,7,Fseries of prosecutions for fly-tipping
OL,8,Fand other waste offences.
OL,10,FMultiple businesses have been ordered
OL,11,Fto pay more than #6,500 at Luton
OL,12,FMagistrates' Court after investigations
OL,13,Fby the council's Enviro Crime team.
OL,15,FAmong them was La Pinata Limited, of St
OL,16,FCuthbert Street, Bedford, which was
OL,17,Ffined #400, and must pay a victim
OL,18,Fsurcharge of #160 and costs of #1,666
OL,19,Ffollowing reports of misusing household
OL,20,Fwaste bins and fly-tipping.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
