OL,3,GNEWSABusinesses fined over waste
OL,4,Aoffences
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Mexican restaurant's company
OL,7,Fdirector Dilzar Miah was also ordered
OL,8,Fto pay a #400 fine along with a #160
OL,9,Fvictim surcharge after failing to
OL,10,Fattend court.
